    <detaileddescription>
<para>HSM Stub Gating Tests</para>
<para>Tests that the HSM stub provider properly enforces security gating:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Requires explicit opt-in via THEMIS_ALLOW_HSM_STUB</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fails in production mode without opt-in</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Detects production environment indicators </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
